Boot←{ ⍝ seed ⍺; pair scores ⍵ → mean low high informative (oracle stats policy); ⍬ if no pairs
    n←≢⍵ ⋄ n=0:⍬
    m←(+/⍵)÷n ⋄ v←(+/(⍵-m)*2)÷n
    (n<10)∨v=0:m,(0⌈m-h),(1⌊m+h←((⍟40)÷2×n)*0.5),0  ⍝ Hoeffding: uninformative
    ⎕RL←⍺ ⋄ r←{⍵[⍋⍵]}(+/⍵[?10000 n⍴n])÷n
    m,r[⌊0.5+9999×0.025 0.975],1  ⍝ percentile pair bootstrap, 10 000 resamples
}
